ts!\\n2. For every 2 friends you successfully invite to register,\\nyou’ll receive 1 free project quota!\\n✅ In this free project, your first generated video won’t deduct any credits.\\n✅ Free projects do not count against your membership entitlements.\\n3. Reward cap: Each user can earn up to 10 free project quotas.\",\"descriptionText\":\"Description\",\"instructionsText\":\"The first generation for each free project is credit-free. You can unlock up to 10 free projects.\",\"invitationCodeText\":\"Invitation code\",\"invitedFriendsText\":\"Invited Friends\",\"pendingText\":\"Pending\",\"upgradeText\":\"Upgrade\",\"usedRewardsText\":\"Number of Used Items / Number of Unlocked Items\"},\"agentInviteNoticeDialog\":{\"btnTxt\":\"Invite Now\",\"subtitle\":\"Get 1 free Vidu Agent project\\nafter 2 successful invites.\",\"title\":\"Invite Friends\u003cspan\u003eEarn Rewards\u003c/span\u003e\"},\"agentProject\":{\"atType\":{\"image\":\"Picture\",\"script\":\"Creation Script\",\"video\":\"Video\"},\"audioUpload\":{\"recreate\":\"Recreate\"},\"back\":\"Back\",\"canvas\":{\"resort\":\"Reset\",\"zoomIn\":\"Zoom In\",\"zoomOut\":\"Zoom Out\"},\"chatDialog\":{\"deleteTabTitle\":\"Confirm to clear the current chat history?\",\"deleteTooltip\":\"Clear Current Conversation History\",\"disableUploadToast\":\"{type} upload is not supported in this scenario\",\"input\":{\"placeholder\":\"Start with an idea or task.\",\"type\":{\"image\":\"Image\",\"text\":\"Text\",\"video\":\"Video\"}},\"maxImageUploadToast\":\"Max {limit} images allowed\",\"maxVideoUploadToast\":\"Max {limit} video allowed\",\"thinking\":\"Thinking...\",\"thinkingToast\":\"Thinking, please wait\"},\"chatSettings\":{\"upgrade\":\"Upgrade\"},\"clawOnline\":\"Vidu Claw Now Online！\",\"collapse\":\"Pack Up\",\"contentType\":{\"audio\":\"Product Audio\",\"image\":\"Product Image\",\"plan\":\"Plan\",\"script\":\"Creation Script\",\"video\":\"Product Video\"},\"create\":\"Create\",\"createByAgent\":\"Created by \u003cspan\