me.\",\"title\":\"Invite Link\",\"toggleAriaLabel\":\"Enable invite link\"},\"inviteOnly\":{\"description\":\"Only users with an invitation link or email can join this workspace\",\"title\":\"Only for Invited Guests\"}},\"credits\":{\"allocate\":{\"batchPlaceholder\":\"Enter amount per member\",\"exceedTip\":\"The allocation exceeds the team's remaining allocatable credits.\",\"placeholder\":\"Enter amount\",\"tip\":\"Team remaining allocatable credits: {count}\",\"title\":\"Allocate Credits\"},\"batch\":{\"deductExceedTip\":\"Some members have insufficient credits to deduct\",\"selected\":\"{count} members selected\"},\"configButton\":\"Allocate Credits\",\"deduct\":{\"batchPlaceholder\":\"Enter deduct amount per member\",\"fillAll\":\"Recover All\",\"placeholder\":\"Enter recovery amount\",\"tip\":\"Member remaining credits: {count}\",\"title\":\"Credits Recovery\"},\"deductButton\":\"Credits Recovery\",\"deductError\":\"Recovery amount must be less than or equal to the member's remaining available credits\",\"insufficient\":\"Insufficient credits. Please contact your account manager to recharge.\",\"search\":{\"placeholder\":\"Search by account\"},\"summary\":{\"consumed\":\"Consumed Credits\",\"remaining\":\"Remaining Credits\",\"teamRemaining\":\"Enterprise Remaining Allocatable Credits\"},\"table\":{\"headers\":{\"consumed\":\"Consumed\",\"remaining\":\"Remaining\"}},\"toolbar\":{\"batchAllocate\":\"Batch Allocate\",\"batchDeduct\":\"Batch Recovery\"}},\"empty\":\"No members yet\",\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"personalWorkspace\":\"Personal Workspace\",\"setting\":{\"displayName\":{\"description\":\"Choose how your team's name is displayed in Vidu\",\"duplicateError\":\"Team name is already in use, please choose another\",\"title\":\"Display name\",\"updateFailed\":\"Failed to update team name, please try again\"}},\"state\":{\"applying\":\"Applying\",\"joined\":\"Joined\",\"unknown\":\"Unknown\"},\"switchToPersonalWorkspace\":\"Switch to Personal Workspace\",\"switchToWorkspace\":\"Switch to {name}'s Workspace\",\"table\":{\"headers\":{\"action\":\"Action\",\"joinDate\":\"Join Date\",\"members\":\"Members\",\"state\":\"State\",\"type\":\"Type\"}},\"tabs\":{\"credits\":\"Credits\",\"members\":\"Members\",\"setting\":\"Setting\"},\"type\":{\"admin\":\"Admin\",\"member\":\"Member\",\"unknown\":\"Unknown\"},\"workspaceFallback\":\"Team Workspace\",\"workspaceTitleWithName\":\"{name}'s Workspace\",\"workspaceWithName\":\"{name}'s Workspace\",\"you\":\"(you)\"},\"template\":{\"prompt\":\"Prompt\"},\"templates\":{\"all\":\"All\",\"button\":\"Create\",\"changeTemplate\":\"Change\",\"errorMessage\":\"This category has been removed\",\"inspiration\":\"Inspirations\",\"noTemplates\":\"No content available\",\"notFound\":\"This template is unavailable for now, try another one~\",\"pickFromGallery\":\"Pick from Gallery\",\"search\":{\"noResults\":\"No matches found\",\"placeholder\":\"Enter Template Name\"},\"title\":\"Templates\",\"tour\":{\"templatePanel\":\"You can switch templates here\",\"uploadImage\":\"Upload your image and start creating now\"},\"viewDetails\":\"Get Inspired\"},\"text2audio\":{\"autoAdjustDuration\":\"Adjusted the total duration for optimal results.\",\"create\":{\"noPrompt\":\"Please input prompt\",\"outOfCredit\":\"Don’t keep your ideas waiting—top up and keep creating! \",\"promptNoTimeTag\":\"Please match each prompt a timestamp for better result, e.g., 01s-04s: raining.\",\"timestampOutOfRange\":\"Please keep the timestamps within the total duration.\",\"timestampOverTip\":\"The number of timestamps may be too high. Around 5 is ideal.\",\"timeTagNoPrompt\":\"Some timestamps are missing prompts. Please add prompts or remove the timestamps.\"},\"description\":\"Exact control over duration, timing, and multiple sound overlaps\",\"freeTrial\":\"Free trial\",\"freeTrialLeft\":\"{time} uses left\",\"timelineEditor\":{\"fillPrompt\":\"Add a timestamp track\",\"intervalTooShort\":\"Better results with intervals over {limit}s\",\"title\":\"Sets total duration\"},\"timestampTextArea\":{\"endTimeEqualZero\":\"The end time should be at least 1 second longer.\",\"endTimeOverEarlierTime\":\"The end time cannot be earlier than the start time.\",\"invalidCharacter\":\"Symbols are not supported for now~\",\"placeholder\":\"Think it, time it, hear it! 🎧 Just tell us the sound and when—like [1s-4s] Raindrops on rooftop. We’ll handle the rest!\",\"sample\":\"Sample\",\"segmentLimitExceeded\":\"Shorter prompts work better.Keep it under {limit} characters.\",\"startTimeLaterEndTime\":\"The start time cannot be later than the end time.\",\"startTimeOverDuration\":\"Keep the start time under {limit} seconds.\",\"timestamp\":\"Timestamp\",\"timestampLimit\":\"Timing is limited to {limit} seconds for now!\",\"timestampTip\":\"Timestamps: Control each sound’s start, end, and duration to the second.\",\"tips\":\"tips\",\"totalLimitExceeded\":\"Shorter prompts work better.Keep it under {limit} characters.\"},\"title\":\"AI Sound Effects\",\"userGuide\":\"User Guide\"},\"tools\":{\"after\":\"After\",\"before\":\"Before\",\"characterCreation\":{\"description\":\"Enter prompts and style to generate References with AI\",\"elementList\":{\"empty\":\"No subjects yet, they will appear here after generation\",\"noDescription\":\"No description\",\"processing\":\"Generating subject\",\"refresh\":\"Refresh subjects\",\"title\":\"Subject List\",\"untitled\":\"Untitled subject\"},\"error\":{\"failed\":\"Subject generation failed. Please try again later.\",\"nameDuplicate\":\"This subject name already exists. Please change it and submit again.\",\"nameRequired\":\"Enter a subject name to create a subject.\",\"promptRequired\":\"Enter a prompt to create a subject.\",\"styleRequired\":\"Select a style to create a subject.\"},\"info\":{\"description\":\"Description\",\"descriptionPlaceholder\":\"Enter subject description\",\"name\":\"Name\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Enter subject name\",\"noVoice\":\"No Voice\",\"tag\":\"Tag\",\"title\":\"Subject Information\",\"voice\":\"Voice\"},\"prompt\":{\"label\":\"Prompt\",\"placeholder\":\"Enter character or prop description and style prompt\"},\"tags\":{\"character\":\"Character\",\"prop\":\"Prop\",\"scene\":\"Scene\"},\"title\":\"Character Generator\"},\"example\":\"Example\",\"faceSwap\":{\"description\":\"One-click face replacement in videos to create new looks easily\",\"sourceImage\":{\"label\":\"Your Photo\"},\"title\":\"AI Face Swap\"},\"historyCreation\":\"history creation\",\"languageOptions\":{\"auto\":\"Auto\",\"en\":\"English\",\"zh\":\"Chinese\"},\"lipSync\":{\"description\":\"Upload a video and add text or audio to generate lip-synced speech\",\"input\":{\"audioHelper\":\"Supports MP3, WAV, AAC, and M4A. Duration must be 1-120 seconds.\",\"audioMode\":\"Audio\",\"label\":\"Speech Content\",\"labelTooltip\":\"Instructions:\\n1. The text content must be at least 4 characters and no more than 1,200 characters (2–600 Chinese characters or 4–1,200 English characters).  \\n2. Supports text input or audio.  \\n3. Pause control: supports customizing the speech interval between text segments. Usage: insert the `\u003c#x#\u003e` tag in the text, where `x` is the pause duration in seconds, ranging from [0.01, 99.99], with up to two decimal places. Multiple pause tags cannot be used consecutively.  \\n4. Pause example: Hello\u003c#2#\u003eI am vidu\u003c#2#\u003eNice to meet you.\",\"labelTooltipAria\":\"View speech content instructions\",\"textMode\":\"Text\",\"textPlaceholder\":\"Enter the text you want the video character to speak...\"},\"settings\":{\"speed\":\"Speech Speed\",\"taskTagSpeed\":\"Speed {speed}\",\"voice\":\"Voice\",\"volume\":\"Custom Volume\"},\"submit\":{\"disabledInvalidText\":\"Text must be between 4 and 2000 characters.\",\"disabledMissingAudio\":\"Upload one audio file first.\",\"disabledMissingVideo\":\"Upload a video first.\",\"disabledMissingVoice\":\"Select a voice first.\"},\"title\":\"AI Lip Sync\",\"videoUpload\":{\"helper\":\"Upload front-facing real face or cartoon character (realistic facial proportions). Duration: 1–120 seconds, max 500MB.\",\"label\":\"Video\",\"labelTooltip\":\"Instructions:\\n1. Video content must not involve portrait rights issues; otherwise, it will be taken down or destroyed.\\n2. Normative requirements for video material: For facial shots, real people must appear on camera (if a cartoon character is used, the character's facial features must be proportionally similar to those of a real person). When the face in the shot is speaking, it is recommended to face the camera directly, with horizontal rotation not exceeding 45 degrees and vertical tilt not exceeding 15 degrees. The face should be kept as unobstructed as possible, and facial lighting should be stable.\",\"labelTooltipAria\":\"View video material instructions\"}},\"motionControl\":{\"description\":\"Upload a motion video and target image to transfer motion to the image subject\",\"error\":{\"invalidImageDimension\":\"Image size must be {min}-{max} px\",\"invalidImageRatio\":\"Image ratio must be {minRatio} to {maxRatio}\",\"invalidVideoDimension\":\"Video size must be {min}-{max} px\",\"invalidVideoRatio\":\"Video ratio must be {minRatio} to {maxRatio}\"},\"materialGuide\":{\"characterImageDescription\":\"Use one clear, unobstructed subject. Keep the person complete and at a suitable size in the frame.\",\"characterImageTitle\":\"Character Image\",\"motionVideoDescription\":\"Use a video with one main performer, stable lighting, and visible full-body motion.\",\"motionVideoTitle\":\"Motion Video\",\"tip\":\"For best motion results, ensure the video or image features a single front-facing person with a clear face and proper framing. See “\u003clink\u003eUpload Guidelines\u003c/link\u003e” for details.\",\"title\":\"Material Guidelines\"},\"motionLibrary\":{\"defaultMotionName\":\"My Motion {timestamp}\",\"delete\":\"Delete motion\",\"deleteFailed\":\"Failed to delete motion. Please try again later.\",\"deleteSuccess\":\"Motion deleted\",\"empty\":\"No motions yet\",\"mine\":\"My Motions\",\"official\":\"Official Motions\",\"officialMotions\":{\"jumping\":\"Jumping\",\"running\":\"Running\"},\"rename\":\"Rename motion\",\"renameCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"renameConfirm\":\"Confirm\",\"renameFailed\":\"Failed to rename motion. Please try again later.\",\"renameSuccess\":\"Motion name updated\",\"title\":\"Motion Library\",\"totalLimitExceeded\":\"You've reached the My Motions limit. Delete some motions and try again.\"},\"motionSavedToast\":\"This video has been saved to My Motions and can be added from the motion library next time\",\"motionVideo\":\"Motion Video\",\"targetImage\":\"Character Image\",\"title\":\"Motion Control\"},\"oneClickMv\":{\"audioUpload\":{\"helper\":\"Upload music with lyrics. Formats: MP3/WAV/AAC/M4A, 10–180 seconds.\",\"label\":\"Audio\"},\"description\":\"Upload audio and image materials and prompts to generate music videos with one click\",\"imageUpload\":{\"helper\":\"Upload 1–7 model or style images. Formats: PNG/JPEG/JPG/WebP, max 50MB each.\"},\"prompt\":{\"label\":\"Prompt\",\"placeholder\":\"Optional. Add style, shot, or mood details for the MV.\"},\"submit\":{\"disabledMissingAudio\":\"Upload one audio file first.\",\"disabledMissingImages\":\"Upload at least one image first.\"},\"subtitle\":{\"invalidSizeWithLimit\":\"Subtitle size exceeds the limit (max {limit}). Please upload a smaller file.\",\"invalidType\":\"Only .srt subtitle files are supported.\"},\"title\":\"AI MV Generator\"},\"oneClickVideoProduction\":{\"aspectRatio\":{\"label\":\"Aspect Ratio\"},\"description\":\"Upload images and prompts to generate stylized videos with one click\",\"duration\":{\"label\":\"Output Duration\"},\"lang\":{\"en\":\"English\",\"label\":\"Voice Language\",\"zh\":\"Chinese\"},\"prompt\":{\"label\":\"Prompt\",\"placeholder\":\"Describe the video effect you want\"},\"scenario\":{\"ecommerce_ad\":{\"description\":\"Optimized for e-commerce advertising to boost marketing\",\"label\":\"E-commerce Ad\"},\"general\":{\"description\":\"Adapts to various scenarios with flexible creation\",\"label\":\"General Scenario\"},\"label\":\"Scenario Selection\"},\"title\":\"One-Click Video Generator\"},\"quickEditForm\":{\"placeholder\":\"Enter a prompt to describe the content you want to generate\",\"toast\":{\"maxImageError\":\"You can upload up to {count} images.\",\"maxTargetImageError\":\"You can upload only 1 target image.\"}},\"storyGrid\":{\"description\":\"AI-generate multi-grid storyboards and create viral short videos with one click\",\"placeholder\":\"Upload one or more characters, props, or scenes as references, and enter your desired storyline.\",\"settings\":{\"gridCount\":\"Grid Count\"},\"title\":\"Story Grid\"},\"styleOptions\":{\"anime\":\"Anime\",\"oilPainting\":\"Oil Painting\",\"realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"sketch\":\"Sketch\",\"watercolor\":\"Watercolor\"},\"styleTransfer\":{\"description\":\"Upload an image and transform its style using text or reference styles\",\"error\":{\"promptOrStyleRequired\":\"Enter a text prompt or select a reference style\",\"sourceImageRequired\":\"Upload a source image first\"},\"referenceStyle\":{\"hint\":\"At least one of text prompt or reference style is required\",\"label\":\"Reference Style\"},\"sourceImage\":\"Source Image\",\"textPrompt\":{\"label\":\"Text Prompt\",\"placeholder\":\"Describe the image style you want, e.g., transform to oil painting style.\"},\"title\":\"Style Transfer\"},\"subtitleSettings\":{\"label\":\"Subtitles\"},\"targetAudio\":\"Target Audio\",\"targetImage\":\"Target Image\",\"targetVideo\":\"Target Video\",\"textToSpeech\":{\"description\":\"Convert text to natural speech with emotion and pause control\",\"emotionButton\":\"Emotion\",\"emotionButtonTooltip\":\"Please select text first to add emotion\",\"emotions\":{\"angry\":\"Angry\",\"disgusted\":\"Disgusted\",\"fearful\":\"Fearful\",\"happy\":\"Happy\",\"neutr